REDISTRIBUTED CONTENT
---------------------

`host/cast/.github/` is a SHA-pinned snapshot of the deployed hve-squad cast,
redistributed verbatim so the container image can resolve real persona bytes at
runtime without an install step. It is generated by `npm run snapshot:cast` and
must not be hand-edited. Every bundled file records its pinned upstream source
and a SHA-256 digest in `host/cast/manifest.json`.

The snapshot resolves through the hve-squad APM package (see
`host/cast/package-pin.json`), which composes content from:

- Peter-N91/hve-squad (MIT License)
- microsoft/hve-core (MIT License; some content CC BY-SA 4.0)
- github/awesome-copilot (MIT License)

Each redistributed file remains under the license of its originating project.
Consult the upstream repositories for the authoritative license text.

THIRD-PARTY DEPENDENCIES
------------------------

Runtime and build dependencies are declared in `package.json` and fetched at
install time into `node_modules/` (git-ignored). Their source is not
redistributed here; each retains its own license.

The container image built from `host/Containerfile` additionally installs
operating-system and Python packages at build time, which retain their own
licenses and are not redistributed in this repository.

